        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ある晴れた日のこと、\n僕はイェンファさんに曲芸を見せてもらっていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "2a01f9a802c66d68fb19326792ee72130bda10f653fef2062f1b1226056be238",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "さあ！　次にお見せするのは\nあたしの十八番、火の輪くぐりですね！",
      "jp_sha256": "1f0330f1a005a34d86df65165bf18b902658f5dc151b5f4ee79256f2a633a0e7",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "자! 다음으로 보여 드릴 것은\n제 특기인 불타는 고리 통과 묘기예요!",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "22c70e09f6458780b2ad6c3847009d9a3ab4081be3ecab659df1711cb11354dc:000000_-5746935636639745265:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "イェンファ",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "さあ！　次にお見せするのは\nあたしの十八番、火の輪くぐりですね！",
        "",
        "ch_10286/R18/10286A0_10286_Nml/10286A0_10286_001",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "イェンファ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10286/R18/10286A0_10286_Nml/10286A0_10286_001"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "ea7a2c4f915ca2b1586d7f63ef8eac8419695cb5918ab8ba6d701a16aa6a0325",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "この細い輪っかをご覧ください。\nちょうどあたしの体が通るくらいの大きさですね～？\nこちらを台座にセットして、輪っかに火を付けまして、と。",
      "jp_sha256": "47076acc69eb01b1df0c09b06d6c18feb984939150a8f3013b022fdd24dc2f40",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "이 가느다란 고리를 보세요.\n딱 제 몸이 통과할 정도 크기죠～?\n이걸 받침대에 설치하고, 고리에 불을 붙이면 됐고요.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 10,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "22c70e09f6458780b2ad6c3847009d9a3ab4081be3ecab659df1711cb11354dc:000000_-5746935636639745265:g0:r9",
      "row_index_0based": 9,
      "serialized_row_index": 9,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "イェンファ",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "この細い輪っかをご覧ください。\nちょうどあたしの体が通るくらいの大きさですね～？\nこちらを台座にセットして、輪っかに火を付けまして、と。",
        "",
        "ch_10286/R18/10286A0_10286_Nml/10286A0_10286_002",
