    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "1284646b2895c56b71f13e199049f289500c989266bd9d6263269e96b413c2f0",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "今からこの輪っかをジャンプでくぐってみせますね！\nまばたきは厳禁ですよ～！　それでは、３、２、１！",
      "jp_sha256": "bab76058750e3eca457a9fcdef796b891f8719a6b1e4f07578eadcd8b1c7d882",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "지금부터 점프해서 이 고리를 통과해 보일게요!\n눈 깜빡이는 건 금지예요～! 그럼, 3, 2, 1!",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 20,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "22c70e09f6458780b2ad6c3847009d9a3ab4081be3ecab659df1711cb11354dc:000000_-5746935636639745265:g0:r19",
      "row_index_0based": 19,
      "serialized_row_index": 19,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "イェンファ",
        "Emt4_Enj",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "今からこの輪っかをジャンプでくぐってみせますね！\nまばたきは厳禁ですよ～！　それでは、３、２、１！",
