    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "ea2edbbc693f78b6a1a388ca84b114ccc002cc5ae1840d90c114930a68bfc96b",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "イェンファさんは助走をつけて加速し、\n勢いよくジャンプして輪の中へ飛び込む。\n燃え盛る火のギリギリを通過し、見事成功した。",
      "jp_sha256": "303a60dc7060bc582d3b877717406b810481d5a4d7632c93c0bd95dc87b6ba9a",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "옌화 씨는 도움닫기로 속도를 높이고,\n힘차게 뛰어올라 고리 안으로 몸을 날렸다.\n활활 타오르는 불꽃 바로 곁을 지나 멋지게 성공했다.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 29,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "22c70e09f6458780b2ad6c3847009d9a3ab4081be3ecab659df1711cb11354dc:000000_-5746935636639745265:g0:r28",
      "row_index_0based": 28,
      "serialized_row_index": 28,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "イェンファさんは助走をつけて加速し、\n勢いよくジャンプして輪の中へ飛び込む。\n燃え盛る火のギリギリを通過し、見事成功した。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "ba7646ff60aa8dce51d951a1b347a8ca95350b6b0118ac4f3da8135d42570515",
