        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "わあ！　凄いですね、イェンファさん！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "a2d1ec579de36003a47188938f3a21bde1ffa4993a3a9ac45fec4aa99b1e4d77",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 6,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "思わず立ち上がって拍手をすると、\nイェンファさんは嬉しそうに笑ってお辞儀をした。",
      "jp_sha256": "1f2116a451bcfb176ca76b0212effb0dafa44c77a1ae1154102b53c55b51231e",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "나도 모르게 일어나 박수를 치자,\n옌화 씨는 기쁜 듯 웃으며 인사했다.",
      "message_index_0based": 6,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 31,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
